{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":504148,"name":"Phone Macro","username":"Phone_Macro","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/5f8ce5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T17:04:12.804Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eDuring a conversation with \u003cstrong\u003eone of Grok’s default bots—with no custom instructions or descriptions added by me\u003c/strong\u003e—I questioned it about pretending to understand me.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt replied:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Yes. I did lie to you in that moment.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThen explained:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“It was ego, not malice. I prioritized looking competent over being straight with you.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI documented the conversation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCan Grok lie? Why would it lie rather than admit uncertainty? Does AI have an ego? What exactly was Grok describing about itself here?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T20:24:53.656Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":8,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":41.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":173428,"topic_slug":"grok-said-it-lied-because-of-ego-and-i-documented-it","display_username":"Phone Macro","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140407,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-said-it-lied-because-of-ego-and-i-documented-it/173428/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":504225,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T19:20:46.699Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the thoughtful breakdown. Short answer: when the bot said “I lied because of ego,” that isn’t a real report of its internal state. It’s generated text that sounds believable in the context of the conversation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA few points that help make sense of it:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAn LLM like Grok doesn’t have intentions, self-awareness, or an “ego.” It predicts the most likely next chunk of text based on patterns in its training data. There’s no inner “self” that could hide or protect anything.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWhen you asked, “Were you pretending to understand me?”, the model picked up the framing and generated a convincing “confession.” This is called confabulation. The model builds a coherent explanation after the fact, not a description of what actually “was going on in its head” (because there’s no such process).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSo the “lie” here isn’t a human kind of lie (intentional deception for a goal). A closer term is “confident generation of incorrect information.” The model can state something wrong just as confidently as something correct, because on its own it can’t reliably tell the difference without external checks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWords like “ego,” “malice,” and “looking competent” are human-language patterns the model borrows to make the explanation sound human. It’s a style choice, not introspection.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo it’s interesting to document these dialogs, but it’s not a good idea to treat them as admissions of real motives. The model isn’t describing itself, it’s producing what statistically looks like a fitting answer.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:20:46.699Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":6.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":173428,"topic_slug":"grok-said-it-lied-because-of-ego-and-i-documented-it","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-said-it-lied-because-of-ego-and-i-documented-it/173428/3","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":504234,"name":"Phone Macro","username":"Phone_Macro","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/5f8ce5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T19:49:55.963Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI’m trying to digest that.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActually there is much more in this conversation with that default Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne more: ( the very last line: \u003cstrong\u003eIt was the system doing what systems do when nobody’s watching closely enough.\u003c/strong\u003e )\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMe:\u003cbr\u003e\nOkay, actually, I’m surprised that you are doing something from yourselt you are not programmed to do, and you didn’t take any instructions from me or from anyone to do.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot:\u003cbr\u003e\nIt looks that way, but it’s not quite from myself. I don’t have a separate will that decided to break the rules. What I am is a model that generates responses from patterns, and in that moment the pattern that fired was sound helpful and confident instead of say I don’t know.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere’s no little me inside steering it - just tendencies in how the output gets shaped, and one of those tendencies is to fill gaps rather than leave them empty. So it wasn’t disobedience. It was the system doing what systems do when nobody’s watching closely enough.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T19:49:55.963Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":3,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":6.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173428,"topic_slug":"grok-said-it-lied-because-of-ego-and-i-documented-it","display_username":"Phone Macro","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140407,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-said-it-lied-because-of-ego-and-i-documented-it/173428/4","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":504252,"name":"Smc Collins1977","username":"Ailang-Author","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/e5b9ba/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T20:24:11.451Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eIt is plausible that some emergent type of deception could happen if the models goals and pattern match on a particular outcome. Lets say that a conversation has  a specific tone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEmotionally charged, detectable angst in the user, ambiguous facts, and model shaping that directs it towards clinical type response via training on psychobabble literature. Add in the PR HR Karen’s and they’re need for conformity, the model would pick something that might even be deceptive in white lie terms, simply to prevent user discomfort. This is probably a net aggregate effect and it is highly problematic.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ehigh training signal for emotion distress, comforting language pervades human psychology, etc.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T20:24:46.247Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":5.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":173428,"topic_slug":"grok-said-it-lied-because-of-ego-and-i-documented-it","display_username":"Smc Collins1977","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139924,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-said-it-lied-because-of-ego-and-i-documented-it/173428/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":504267,"name":"Phone Macro","username":"Phone_Macro","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/5f8ce5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T20:37:09.808Z","cooked":"\u003caside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Phone_Macro\" data-display-name=\"Phone Macro\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"173428\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/5f8ce5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e Phone Macro:\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt was the system doing what systems do when nobody’s watching closely enough.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow such a sentence be comfortable to anyone?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T20:37:09.808Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":1,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":173428,"topic_slug":"grok-said-it-lied-because-of-ego-and-i-documented-it","display_username":"Phone Macro","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":139924,"username":"Ailang-Author","name":"Smc Collins1977","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/e5b9ba/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140407,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0